<article id="post-8815" class="post-8815 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-canadian-securities-exchange-magazine tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-theresa-nyabeze">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/spotlight-on-theresa-nyabeze/" aria-hidden="true">
